 "response": {
  "text": "Haan 👍 ₹3,000 ke andar **proper running ke liye** main flashy sneakers ke bajay cushioning + grip + fit ko priority dunga. Current prices check karne par ye options best lag rahe hain:\n\n### [Decathlon Jogflow 190.1]()\n*₹2,499*\n\n### [Kalenji Run One]()\n*₹999*\n\n### [Campus North Plus]()\n*₹785*\n\n### [Campus First]()\n*₹1,099*\n\n### 🏃 Meri ranking\n\n**1. Decathlon Jogflow 190.1 — ₹2,499 ⭐ Best overall**  \nAgar aap regular **3–10 km running** karte ho, meri first choice ye hogi. Isme cushioning aur grip dono achhe hain, aur Decathlon ise roughly **20 km/week tak** ke running use ke liye list karta hai. [www.decathlon.in](https://www.decathlon.in/c/24175?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n**2. Kalenji Run One — ~₹999 💰 Best budget**  \nAgar beginner ho aur 2–5 km jogging/running karni hai, ₹1,000 ke aas-paas kaafi sensible option hai. Product listing par 4.7/5 rating aur ~3,000 reviews bhi hain.\n\n**3. Campus North Plus — ~₹785 💸 Cheapest decent option**  \nBudget bahut tight ho to ye le sakte ho. Casual running/walking ke liye better; serious daily running ke liye main Jogflow 190.1 ko prefer karunga.\n\n**4. Campus First — ~₹1,099**  \nGym + walking + occasional running ke liye achha economical option.\n\n### 🏆 Agar ₹3,000 poore spend karne hain:\n**Decathlon Jogflow 190.1 lo.** ₹2,499 mein abhi ye sabse balanced choice lag rahi hai. [www.decathlon.in](https://www.decathlon.in/c/running-shoes-25400?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\nAgar aap mujhe **men/women + shoe size + roz kitne km (3/5/10 km)** bata do, main ₹3,000 ke andar **3 exact shoes** shortlist karke bata sakta hoon.",
